      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Additional feedback: I did copy and modify an instance of the proxy_tpose and added an enable/disable key for a game object. I am assuming the layer is not meant to work with modifying game object or states, but only for setting the avatar's maximum wingspan, etc.",
